 "applies_to": "Caleffi LEGIOMIX 6000 series (product type 6001) electronic mixing valves with thermal disinfection, connected to BACnet through the Caleffi gateway code 755052.",
 "summary": "The LEGIOMIX 6000 is an electronic thermostatic mixing valve for domestic hot water with programmable thermal disinfection and thermal shock. The Caleffi 755052 gateway maps its Modbus RTU registers to Analog and Binary Values on BACnet MS/TP or BACnet IP: mixed and recirculation temperatures, valve state, setpoints, disinfection schedule and timers, clock settings and command/reset objects.",
